# README media: SELECT's cartridge card over the library (ROOFCAT after a
# couple of minutes' play), and its CONTROLS page with A and B swapped
set_goals roofcat 3
wait 30
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 30
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press A
wait 7400
test_pause 0
wait 2
press UP
press A
wait 60
press SELECT
wait 20
shotscale 2
shot library_card
press A
press A
wait 20
shot library_card_controls
press DOWN
press A
wait 2
wipe_saves
